\par   \tab  \tab Thieves of any kit may choose any of these new proficiencies. However, if the kit is not listed as appropriate in the proficiency's description, then an additi
onal proficiency slot beyond the number listed is required, just as if the proficiency were restricted to another class (cf.}{\i\fs24  Player's Handbook}{\fs24 
