\par    \tab If th
e die roll fails, this does not mean that all creatures hearing the noise know that the sound is fake. While creatures and humanoids that are very familiar with the noise know this automatically, other creatures or characters in earshot may require Wisdom
 checks to determine if they detect the fake.
\par    \tab Bandits and Smugglers often use this ability for communication on the job, almost as a variant dialect of thieves' cant.
